          "C": "1![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)3![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)5![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)3![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)7![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)3![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)6![题图](exam-assets/1735356969686/23a0babd49bb5e.png)12",
